# Genetic Algorithms: A Pragmatic, Non-Parametric Approach to Exploratory Analysis of Questionnaires in Educational Research.

**Authors:** Madden, Andrew D.

## Abstract
Explains genetic algorithms, a means of generating logical rules that predict one variable by relating it to others. Describes how they can be applied to analysis of survey data. (SK)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ587126

